---
// Infográfico para leigos: escolha o que você quer e veja o caminho
// (de onde a pessoa vem → o que ela faz na página → onde você recebe).
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro';
import BrandIcon, { type BrandName } from '../ui/BrandIcon.astro';
import type { IconName } from '../ui/icons';
import { SOLUTIONS } from '../../data/solutions';

const pages = SOLUTIONS.filter((s) => s.group === 'landing' && s.flow);
const unique = (key: 'from' | 'action' | 'to') => [...new Set(pages.flatMap((p) => p.flow![key]))];
const columns = { from: unique('from'), action: unique('action'), to: unique('to') };

const NODE_ICON: Record<string, { brand?: BrandName; icon?: IconName }> = {
  Google: { brand: 'google' },
  Instagram: { brand: 'instagram' },
  Anúncios: { brand: 'meta' },
  Indicação: { icon: 'people' },
  WhatsApp: { brand: 'whatsapp' },
  'Chama no WhatsApp': { brand: 'whatsapp' },
  'Preenche um formulário': { icon: 'form' },
  'Compra ou testa': { icon: 'cart' },
  'Se inscreve': { icon: 'ticket' },
  'Seu WhatsApp': { brand: 'whatsapp' },
  'E-mail': { icon: 'mail' },
  Planilha: { brand: 'sheets' },
  CRM: { icon: 'people' },
  Pagamento: { icon: 'card' },
};

const GOAL_ICON: Record<string, IconName> = {
  'landing-page-alto-padrao': 'gem',
  'landing-page-campanhas': 'target',
  'landing-page-produto': 'box',
  'landing-page-palestras': 'ticket',
};

const startIndex = Math.max(0, pages.findIndex((p) => p.slug === 'landing-page-campanhas'));
const active = pages[startIndex].flow!;
---
<div class="lf" data-flow>
  <div class="lf__goals" role="tablist" aria-label="O que você quer com a página?">
    {pages.map((p, i) => (
      <button
        type="button"
        role="tab"
        class="goal"
        aria-selected={i === startIndex ? 'true' : 'false'}
        tabindex={i === startIndex ? 0 : -1}
        data-pick
        data-flow-from={p.flow!.from.join('|')}
        data-flow-action={p.flow!.action.join('|')}
        data-flow-to={p.flow!.to.join('|')}
        data-panel={`lf-${p.slug}`}
      >
        <span class="goal__icon"><Icon name={GOAL_ICON[p.slug] ?? 'layout'} /></span>
        <span class="goal__text">
          <strong>{p.goal}</strong>
          <span>Landing page de {p.label.toLowerCase()}</span>
        </span>
      </button>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="lf__map">
    <div class="lf__col">
      <p class="lf__head"><span class="lf__n">1</span> A pessoa vem do</p>
      <ul role="list" class="lf__nodes">
        {columns.from.map((n) => (
          <li class:list={['node', { 'is-on': active.from.includes(n) }]} data-node="from" data-value={n}>
            {NODE_ICON[n]?.brand ? <BrandIcon name={NODE_ICON[n].brand!} class="node__icon" /> : <Icon name={NODE_ICON[n]?.icon ?? 'check'} class="node__icon" />}
            {n}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <svg class="lf__link" viewBox="0 0 40 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12h34m-7-7 7 7-7 7" /></svg>

    <div class="lf__col lf__col--action">
      <p class="lf__head"><span class="lf__n">2</span> Na sua página, ela</p>
      <ul role="list" class="lf__nodes">
        {columns.action.map((n) => (
          <li class:list={['node', 'node--action', { 'is-on': active.action.includes(n) }]} data-node="action" data-value={n}>
            {NODE_ICON[n]?.brand ? <BrandIcon name={NODE_ICON[n].brand!} class="node__icon" /> : <Icon name={NODE_ICON[n]?.icon ?? 'check'} class="node__icon" />}
            {n}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <svg class="lf__link" viewBox="0 0 40 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12h34m-7-7 7 7-7 7" /></svg>

    <div class="lf__col">
      <p class="lf__head"><span class="lf__n">3</span> Você recebe no</p>
      <ul role="list" class="lf__nodes">
        {columns.to.map((n) => (
          <li class:list={['node', { 'is-on': active.to.includes(n) }]} data-node="to" data-value={n}>
            {NODE_ICON[n]?.brand ? <BrandIcon name={NODE_ICON[n].brand!} class="node__icon" /> : <Icon name={NODE_ICON[n]?.icon ?? 'check'} class="node__icon" />}
            {n}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="lf__story" aria-live="polite">
    {pages.map((p, i) => (
      <div class="lf__panel" id={`lf-${p.slug}`} role="tabpanel" hidden={i !== startIndex}>
        <p>{p.story}</p>
        <a class="link-arrow" href={p.path} style={`view-transition-name: sol-${p.slug}`}>
          Ver {p.name.toLowerCase()}
          <Icon name="arrow-right" />
        </a>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-flow]').forEach((root) => {
    const picks = [...root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-pick]')];
    const nodes = [...root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-node]')];
    const links = [...root.querySelectorAll<SVGElement>('.lf__link')];

    const select = (index: number, focus = false) => {
      const pick = picks[index];
      const on: Record<string, string[]> = {
        from: (pick.dataset.flowFrom ?? '').split('|'),
        action: (pick.dataset.flowAction ?? '').split('|'),
        to: (pick.dataset.flowTo ?? '').split('|'),
      };
      picks.forEach((p, i) => {
        p.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(i === index));
        p.tabIndex = i === index ? 0 : -1;
        const panel = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`#${p.dataset.panel}`);
        if (panel) panel.hidden = i !== index;
      });
      nodes.forEach((n) => n.classList.toggle('is-on', on[n.dataset.node!]?.includes(n.dataset.value!) ?? false));
      links.forEach((l) => {
        l.classList.remove('is-running');
        void l.getBoundingClientRect();
        l.classList.add('is-running');
      });
      if (focus) pick.focus();
    };

    picks.forEach((pick, i) => {
      pick.addEventListener('click', () => select(i));
      pick.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
        const keys: Record<string, number> = {
          ArrowRight: (i + 1) % picks.length,
          ArrowDown: (i + 1) % picks.length,
          ArrowLeft: (i - 1 + picks.length) % picks.length,
          ArrowUp: (i - 1 + picks.length) % picks.length,
        };
        if (event.key in keys) {
          event.preventDefault();
          select(keys[event.key], true);
        }
      });
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .lf {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 0.75rem + 1vw, 1.75rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  /* Objetivos */
  .lf__goals {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 560px) {
    .lf__goals {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  .goal {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    min-height: 3.5rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.875rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-control);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .goal:hover {
    border-color: var(--line-strong);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .goal[aria-selected='true'] {
    border-color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--on-dark);
  }

  .goal__icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: none;
    width: 2.25rem;
    height: 2.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-control);
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .goal[aria-selected='true'] .goal__icon {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .goal__icon :global(svg) {
    width: 1.25rem;
    height: 1.25rem;
  }

  .goal__text {
    display: grid;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .goal__text strong {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .goal__text span {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .goal[aria-selected='true'] .goal__text span {
    color: var(--on-dark-muted);
  }

  /* Mapa */
  .lf__map {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .lf__col {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 0.625rem;
  }

  .lf__col--action {
    padding: 0.875rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-control);
    background: var(--accent-tint);
  }

  .lf__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .lf__n {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.375rem;
    height: 1.375rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--on-dark);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .lf__nodes {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .node {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-control);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    opacity: 0.5;
    transition:
      opacity 0.35s var(--ease-out),
      background-color 0.35s var(--ease-out),
      border-color 0.35s var(--ease-out),
      color 0.35s var(--ease-out),
      transform 0.35s var(--ease-out);
  }

  .node :global(.node__icon) {
    width: 1.25rem;
    height: 1.25rem;
    flex: none;
    filter: grayscale(1);
    transition: filter 0.35s var(--ease-out);
  }

  .node.is-on {
    border-color: var(--ink);
    color: var(--ink);
    opacity: 1;
    font-weight: 600;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-raised);
  }

  .node.is-on :global(.node__icon) {
    filter: none;
  }

  .node--action {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .node--action.is-on {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .node--action.is-on :global(.node__icon) {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .node--action.is-on :global(svg path[fill]) {
    fill: #fff;
  }

  .lf__link {
    justify-self: center;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 1.25rem;
    transform: rotate(90deg);
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--ink);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-dasharray: 60;
  }

  /* História */
  .lf__story {
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .lf__panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .lf__panel[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .lf__panel p {
    max-width: 52rem;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .lf__link.is-running path {
      animation: lf-draw 0.7s var(--ease-out);
    }

    .node.is-on {
      animation: lf-on 0.45s var(--ease-out);
    }
  }

  @keyframes lf-draw {
    from {
      stroke-dashoffset: 60;
    }
  }

  @keyframes lf-on {
    from {
      transform: translateY(4px);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 880px) {
    .lf__goals {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .lf__map {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1.1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: center;
      column-gap: 1rem;
    }

    .lf__link {
      transform: none;
    }

    .lf__nodes {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
  }
</style>
